(
    schema: 1,
    entries: {
        "the_lower_kingdoms:map:dungeon": "A 24x24 dungeon: sixteen 6x6 rooms, doors between most of them, a few pillars.\n\nPlaced groups in the second row of rooms, rats only until the fight systems have been played (owner, 2026-09-13): the pair the M4 acceptance clears (from the start: forward x5, turn left, forward x2, turn right, use, forward x3), a wary one that comes back, and a friendly one. A small random table of rats on top. Goblins and skeletons in the lower two rows of rooms (M7b, measured by `clear_over_seeds` before the owner plays).",
        "the_lower_kingdoms:map:dungeon/0/23,23": "The way down to the depths (M7b), in the far corner. The tileset has no stairs-down art yet, so the up stairs stand in (pixel art is placeholder, PRD D26).",
    },
)